*.jks
*.keystore
# The release keystore as it actually sits in this working tree: a PKCS#12 store with no file
# extension, which the two patterns above therefore do not match. Committing it would publish the
# key that signs every update - and a published upload key cannot be un-published, only reset with
# Google's help. Named explicitly rather than trusting a glob.
/a-cast-player-release
*.apk
*.aab
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# Agent working artifacts (worktrees, logs) - logcat captures in here can contain full stream
# URLs, including Xtream credentials passed as query params, so this must never be committed.
.claude/
shots/
